OL,3,GNEWSASchools lay foundations for
OL,4,Aconstruction careers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 2,000 schoolchildren tried their
OL,7,Fhand at trades during a construction
OL,8,Fand engineering event.
OL,10,FEighty businesses gave young people
OL,11,Faged between 10 and 18 an opportunity
OL,12,Fto try activities such as bricklaying,
OL,13,Fplastering and carpentry at
OL,14,FLincolnshire Showground.
OL,16,FThe three-day event follows comments by
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who said
OL,18,Fthe education system should offer a
OL,19,Fpath for all young people, whether they
OL,20,Fchose academic or technical routes into
OL,21,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
