OL,3,GNEWSASchools lay foundations for
OL,4,Aconstruction careers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarai Dowding, a teacher at Sir William
OL,7,FRobertson Academy, in Welbourn, said:
OL,8,F"As teachers we love to tell them about
OL,9,Fcareers, but I can't tell them what
OL,10,Fit's like to work in construction."
